  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a6c67cf053282214b9cdb6d167b72a08, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialogues:
  - '* . . .'
  - '*  C# is sleeping'
  - '*  Do you want to wake him up?'
  - 
  - Oh, hello there stranger!
  - It has been several weeks since somebody last visited this shrine-
  - It was a NIGHTMARE. . .
  - Sorry for going off track.
  - May i ask your name?
  - 
  - OK, what is your name?
  - 
  - '"YES"? That is a pretty strange name. . .'
  - What is your purpose of coming to shrine?
  - ' '
  - '. . . '
  - I SWEAR THIS IS EXACTLY WHAT HAPPENED LAST TIME.
  - BRO THAT MF STAYED SILENT ENTIRE CONVERSATION, NOW YOU?
  - YOU KEEO SAYING YES
  - ARE YOY TRYINF TO RA-
  - wait. . .
  - You looked too familiar. . .
  - OH HELK NAH ITS YOU AGAIN
  - I had to move to here, because of YOU.
  - how tf did you even get past my -
  - Omega Security Lock System (OSLS) created by Lomgle - a mindful and considerate
    admin???
  - 
  - . . .
  - Nice try. . .
  - Toxic vl
  - Trlt humn. . .
  - Noidaukhophai. . .
  - Noidaukhongthedientathanhloi. . .
  - Last time, you answered those questions easily. . .
  - 'THIS TIME, HOWEBER - '
  - IM GOING TO FURTHET MANIPYALTE THE GAME
  - YOU WILL
  - TRLT SEE
  - THE
  - TIMESKIP OX.
  - see you soon.
  message_index: 0
  message: {fileID: 1781515528}
  isTyping: 0
  typeSpeed: 0.07
